1
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:42,990
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,350 --> 00:01:45,960
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,750
Qingyuan!

4
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:52,090
Don't ruin your entire family

5
00:01:52,470 --> 00:01:53,840
just for your mother!

6
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:56,200
This has...

7
00:01:58,789 --> 00:01:59,990
never been my family.

8
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:04,070
Qingyuan!

9
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:13,640
[Harmony Among Kin]

10
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,590
Since Zhenglun

11
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:19,180
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

12
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,460
was registered under my name,

13
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:19,530
he's the legitimate eldest son
of the Xie family.

14
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,630
He deserves

15
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,329
a respectable funeral.

16
00:02:22,870 --> 00:02:25,710
I've invited the Taoist priest
from Qingyang Temple

17
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:27,840
to conduct rites for 7 days.

18
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,220
Please rest assured, Mother.

19
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:33,630
Wenzhuo.

20
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,530
Yes, Mother.

21
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,520
See to it that

22
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:39,400
Yinghua's properly taken care of.

23
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:41,030
When the funeral takes place,

24
00:02:41,030 --> 00:02:44,030
it's only natural and right
for the biological mother

25
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:47,240
to see her son off one last time.

26
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:49,280
Mother,

27
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:51,910
the physician said

28
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,690
psychosis is most easily triggered
by funerals.

29
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:58,430
If she makes a scene in the mourning hall,

30
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:01,160
it'll be a nightmare to handle.

31
00:03:05,030 --> 00:03:08,910
You're truly born stupid.

32
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,850
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

33
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,870
A son of the Xie family

34
00:03:22,070 --> 00:03:23,520
fell on the battlefield,

35
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,520
bringing supreme glory to our name.

36
00:03:27,150 --> 00:03:29,710
If outsiders find out that
you, the Head Madam,

37
00:03:29,710 --> 00:03:32,040
prevented his birth mother, a concubine,

38
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,430
from attending

39
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:37,590
the funeral of her son
who died with military distinction,

40
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:40,710
it's not just you who will be disgraced.

41
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:42,680
If you're worried,

42
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,680
assign four matrons to watch her.

43
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:49,240
When the time comes,
she can pay her respects

44
00:03:50,190 --> 00:03:51,590
in the side hall.

45
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:54,310
Yes.

46
00:03:54,990 --> 00:03:59,329
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

47
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:06,840
For now, other than Zhenglun's funeral,

48
00:04:08,150 --> 00:04:09,410
leave everything else

49
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,470
in this house alone.

50
00:04:19,570 --> 00:04:22,790
[Harmony Among Kin]

51
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:28,510
It's been 20 years.

52
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:36,150
I poured my heart and soul
into this family.

53
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,460
But even with Mei Yinghua
out of the picture,

54
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:42,850
she still treats me like this.

55
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:46,580
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

56
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:45,240
Madam,

57
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,390
don't worry.

58
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:49,150
At best, the Old Madam is weaponizing

59
00:04:49,150 --> 00:04:52,280
her seniority and demands for filial piety
against you.

60
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:55,150
We're not without a backer.

61
00:04:56,070 --> 00:04:57,330
You have your brother.

62
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,050
Why be afraid of her?

63
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:05,800
I can only rely on him now.

64
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:10,200
[Cultivate Personal Virtue and Integrity]

65
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,000
My Lady,

66
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,010
I've bought the dried persimmons
you asked for.

67
00:05:23,010 --> 00:05:25,160
A portion's been sent to the mourning hall
for Eldest Young Master.

68
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,090
I brought the other portion to you.

69
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,520
By the way,

70
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:31,630
here's a letter from Lord Yan.

71
00:05:33,790 --> 00:05:36,690
[Respectfully to
Fourth Lady Qingyuan]

72
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,870
Did Lord Yan

73
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,630
apologize to you?

74
00:05:45,650 --> 00:05:46,830
There was no argument to begin with.

75
00:05:46,830 --> 00:05:47,960
Why'd he apologize?

76
00:05:49,630 --> 00:05:51,630
He's asking me to go see Granny Chen.

77
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:54,700
I bet he wants her to
put in a good word for him.

78
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,390
He's just counting on the fact

79
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:58,510
that you can't be angry with him
in front of Granny.

80
00:05:56,909 --> 00:05:58,550
[Sincerely, Yan Rui]

81
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,430
What's wrong?

82
00:06:01,430 --> 00:06:02,690
Did something happen?

83
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,480
Granny is ill.

84
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,310
Lord Yan found out you were sick

85
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,630
before I did.

86
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:15,930
He's here too, to take care of you.

87
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:18,000
Here.

88
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:19,470
Thank you.

89
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,040
Granny,

90
00:06:24,310 --> 00:06:26,040
I've been a bad granddaughter.

91
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:28,430
Don't say that.

92
00:06:29,630 --> 00:06:32,190
I just caught a mild cold,

93
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:34,490
and I'm almost all better already.

94
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:36,870
I'm thrilled that

95
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,000
you and Yan are here.

96
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,830
But my baby,

97
00:06:41,390 --> 00:06:43,950
running out so late at night,

98
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:45,210
are you sure it's okay?

99
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,070
It's fine.

100
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,680
The entire Xie family is in a mess

101
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,310
and busy with the funeral.

102
00:06:50,310 --> 00:06:51,710
No one has time to mind me.

103
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,150
I heard about that too.

104
00:06:58,510 --> 00:07:00,800
They all say Eldest Young Master Xie

105
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:03,040
was an upright man.

106
00:07:05,430 --> 00:07:06,360
What a pity.

107
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,720
Dear,

108
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:13,870
don't be too sad.

109
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:15,950
Eldest Young Master Xie

110
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:18,360
led a noble and virtuous life.

111
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,680
He's destined for a blessed next life.

112
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:24,070
He'll be born into
a wealthy and kind family.

113
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:32,130
I'll go boil the medicine for you.

114
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,430
Then I'll recover even faster.

115
00:07:39,070 --> 00:07:39,830
Yan.

116
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,320
Come here.

117
00:07:43,750 --> 00:07:44,360
Come here!

118
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,240
Granny.

119
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:49,830
Yan,

120
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:51,950
Yunya has always

121
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:54,120
kept things to herself
since she was little.

122
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,190
It seems

123
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:58,150
Eldest Young Master Xie's death has been

124
00:07:58,510 --> 00:07:59,770
quite a big blow to her.

125
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,720
Please help me comfort her.

126
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,160
Rest assured.

127
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:19,390
These are freshly dried persimmons
from Northern Frontier.

128
00:08:19,390 --> 00:08:20,720
They're soft and sweet.

129
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,250
I picked three kinds

130
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,410
and chose the sweetest one for you.

131
00:08:24,510 --> 00:08:25,170
Take a look.

132
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,190
If you like them,

133
00:08:27,630 --> 00:08:29,430
I'll dry a whole rack when I get back

134
00:08:29,430 --> 00:08:30,960
just for us siblings to eat.

135
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,240
Are you okay?

136
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:06,630
I'm fine.

137
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,650
Even Granny Chen could tell
you're troubled.

138
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,650
She asked me to comfort you.

139
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:21,170
When my eldest brother

140
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,360
came back this time,

141
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:26,640
he brought me some
Northern Frontier dried persimmons.

142
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:28,130
I liked them very much.

143
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:31,120
He said he'd bring me more next time.

144
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,660
But there won't be a next time.

145
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:37,390
Sometimes I wonder:

146
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:40,630
if I hadn't

147
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,510
come to the Xie Residence,

148
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,720
would he still be alive?

149
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,360
Yan Rui,

150
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,790
why are human lives

151
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,240
so short?

152
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,360
So short that there's...

153
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:07,840
not even time for a proper goodbye.

154
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,440
Xie Qingyuan,

155
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:20,040
it's not your fault.

156
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,290
That was a battlefield,

157
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:25,150
where thousands of lives are sacrificed
for one general's victory.

158
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:26,360
As a general,

159
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,810
Zhenglun must've been prepared for this.

160
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:35,390
Many soldiers perish in battle.

161
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,060
Zhenglun isn't the first,

162
00:10:38,550 --> 00:10:39,960
and he won't be the last.

163
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:49,000
I've seen arrows fall like rainstorms

164
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:53,550
and wounded comrades crawling in the mud.

165
00:10:54,870 --> 00:10:56,800
The blood soaked in melted snow...

166
00:10:59,150 --> 00:11:00,480
is as hot as this stove.

167
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:17,410
I've actually been wanting to ask you...

168
00:11:21,630 --> 00:11:22,510
Are you...

169
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,250
-Actually, I…
-Yan.

170
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,300
It's time to go.

171
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:30,510
It's 7:45 PM.

172
00:11:36,510 --> 00:11:37,440
You're leaving?

173
00:11:42,750 --> 00:11:44,680
Hengtang is full of watchful eyes.

174
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,600
If we don't leave now,

175
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,530
who knows what trouble might come.

176
00:11:56,550 --> 00:11:57,880
Wait for me to come back.

177
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:02,560
When I come back,

178
00:12:02,910 --> 00:12:04,510
whatever you want to know...

179
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,200
I will tell you.

180
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:39,630
I told you

181
00:12:39,910 --> 00:12:41,840
she'd only hold you back.

182
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,970
[Chen]

183
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,750
So,

184
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:45,960
you came to find me an hour early?

185
00:12:47,750 --> 00:12:49,410
I'm cutting the Gordian knot.

186
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,560
You were reluctant to leave,

187
00:12:51,670 --> 00:12:53,080
so I had to give you a push.

188
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:02,200
Let Granny have a look at you.

189
00:13:06,670 --> 00:13:07,870
You've lost weight.

190
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,840
Blame the chefs at Xie Residence.

191
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:12,900
Their cooking isn't as good as yours.

192
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:16,840
When did you learn to be a smooth talker?

193
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:18,270
Sit here.

194
00:13:18,870 --> 00:13:20,720
I'll make you 2 sugar pancakes,

195
00:13:20,910 --> 00:13:22,720
your favorite when you were a kid.

196
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:23,320
Granny,

197
00:13:23,670 --> 00:13:25,930
you just took your medicine. Go to sleep.

198
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:26,960
I'm okay.

199
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,960
Feel my forehead.

200
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:30,550
After taking your medicine,
my fever is gone.

201
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,450
You don't want food,

202
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:35,670
but I do! How else am I

203
00:13:35,670 --> 00:13:36,630
to fall asleep?

204
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:39,960
Eat some with me.

205
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,510
Okay.

206
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:43,360
I'll make it.

207
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,440
Will it taste the same if you make it?

208
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:47,960
Sit here and wait.

209
00:13:50,670 --> 00:13:53,000
Yan is such a good kid.

210
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:17,840
When I come back,

211
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,660
whatever you want to know,

212
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:21,610
I will tell you.

213
00:14:27,550 --> 00:14:28,510
Granny?

214
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,200
Granny.

215
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,550
Lady Xie.

216
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,500
Lord Wei, what brings you here

217
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,000
at this late hour?

218
00:14:46,550 --> 00:14:49,440
I came to ask you
for a cup of tea, of course.

219
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,360
Sorry to trouble you.

220
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,440
I only have low-grade tea,

221
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:59,030
which might not suit your taste.

222
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,030
Therefore,

223
00:15:01,910 --> 00:15:03,790
I must trouble you

224
00:15:03,790 --> 00:15:05,200
to come with me.

225
00:15:08,230 --> 00:15:09,850
Yunya, run!

226
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,320
Granny!

227
00:15:14,150 --> 00:15:14,870
Let her go!

228
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,890
I'll go with you.

229
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:48,440
My Lord!

230
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:51,020
Stop the carriage.

231
00:15:51,790 --> 00:15:52,550
My Lord!

232
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:54,910
Fourth Lady's been abducted.

233
00:15:54,910 --> 00:15:56,320
I was also told to relay a message:

234
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,360
go to the old Shen residence

235
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,320
alone,

236
00:15:58,550 --> 00:15:59,550
or she dies!

237
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,790
If you go,

238
00:16:05,030 --> 00:16:06,510
we're no longer brothers.

239
00:16:22,910 --> 00:16:23,790
Lord Wei,

240
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,410
if you're trying to use me as bait

241
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:28,000
to lure Lord Yan out,

242
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:30,440
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

243
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:32,830
I'm just a plaything for Lord Yan

244
00:16:33,030 --> 00:16:34,320
in Hengtang

245
00:16:34,670 --> 00:16:35,510
to kill time

246
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:37,550
when he is bored.

247
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,530
If you don't believe me,

248
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:42,390
you can lock me up for a night and see.

249
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,670
Ouch, My Lady,

250
00:16:44,870 --> 00:16:47,070
your words are like daggers to my heart.

251
00:16:50,790 --> 00:16:52,550
Lord Yan, how gutsy of you

252
00:16:53,030 --> 00:16:54,870
to come alone.

253
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,510
Impressive.

254
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:58,870
Lord Wei,

255
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:01,520
you went to such lengths to lure me here,

256
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:03,080
but have you ever considered

257
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,160
that if you kill me,

258
00:17:04,510 --> 00:17:05,770
you won't live either?

259
00:17:08,349 --> 00:17:09,550
Then let's find out.

260
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,349
Even if I can't defeat you,

261
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:27,460
someone will accompany me
to the afterlife.

262
00:17:36,790 --> 00:17:37,830
Lord Yan,

263
00:17:38,270 --> 00:17:39,330
doesn't this place

264
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,160
feel familiar to you?

265
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,160
My Lord,

266
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,110
guilty of bribery and corruption,

267
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,680
Shen Zhibai's estate has been seized,

268
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,160
and 73 people in his residence

269
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,790
have been executed on the spot.

270
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:06,480
But...

271
00:18:06,590 --> 00:18:07,270
What is it?

272
00:18:08,100 --> 00:18:09,310
His eldest son, Shen Run,

273
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:10,370
wasn't among them.

274
00:18:10,550 --> 00:18:12,880
Someone saw him in a house
in the south of the city.

275
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,410
Leave no survivors.

276
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:15,880
Go find him now!

277
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:16,720
Yes!

278
00:18:22,070 --> 00:18:23,640
That night, 9 years ago,

279
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:27,310
the whole family here
was killed overnight,

280
00:18:28,550 --> 00:18:30,550
and only two kids managed to escape.

281
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:40,350
Before, I couldn't figure out

282
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,160
why you,

283
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:46,270
Lord Yan, targeted me at every turn.

284
00:18:48,750 --> 00:18:50,480
But the night of the grain distribution,

285
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:51,740
