515
00:33:15,720 --> 00:33:16,510
In the end,

516
00:33:17,070 --> 00:33:19,270
it's just picking from
the leftovers of these

517
00:33:19,270 --> 00:33:20,530
four or five families.

518
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:22,940
Even if both families detest each other,

519
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:24,240
